{"symbol":"ABE.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:46:26Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Europejska 4","city":"Magnice","zip":"55-040","country":"Poland","phone":"48 71 393 7600","fax":"48 713 93 7529","website":"https://www.ab.pl","industry":"Electronics & Computer Distribution","industryKey":"electronics-computer-distribution","industryDisp":"Electronics & Computer Distribution","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"AB S.A., together with its subsidiaries, distributes IT products primarily in Poland, the Czech Republic, and Slovakia. It engages in the wholesale trade of computers, computer hardware, toys, multimedia, electronic equipment, audiovisual equipment, and household appliances; licensing of computer programs; retail trade in computer hardware; toys; manufacturing of personal computers; leasing of warehouses; and logistics activities. The company also offers IT devices; servers and networks; phones and GPS; photos and optics; household goods; TV sets, home cinema sets, car stereos, voice recorders, Hi-Fi equipment, multimedia players, and blueray / DVD players; office equipment and supplies, computers, monitors, printers, scanners, consumables, and software products; lighting products; fitness and sport products; and construction and assembly, protective clothing, power tools, and hand tools. In addition, it provides automotive products and accessories, including breathalyzers, cameras and parking sensors, navigation, car recorders, car audio equipment, multimedia stations, CB radios, and hands-free kits, as well as power supplies and chargers; and home products comprising assistants, control panels, sensors, controllers, triggers, and light sources for configuration of an intelligent building. Further, the company offers facility monitoring products, such as alarms, sensors, intercoms / videophones, wired and wireless cameras, recorders and monitoring sets, as well as gardening tools, mowers and sprayers, garden furniture, and barbecues; and marketing, financing, and training services. AB S.A. was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Magnice, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":1014,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Zbigniew  Madry","title":"President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Grzegorz  Ochêdzan","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Patrycja  Gawarecka","title":"Chief Commercial Officer & VP of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jaroslaw  Slowinski","title":"COO & Vice President of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Magdalena  Kosatka","title":"Chief Accountant","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":135,"open":134,"dayLow":133,"dayHigh":136,"regularMarketPreviousClose":135,"regularMarketOpen":134,"regularMarketDayLow":133,"regularMarketDayHigh":136,"dividendRate":6.45,"dividendYield":4.78,"exDividendDate":1775692800,"payoutRatio":0.4406,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":2.35,"beta":0.555,"trailingPE":9.22131,"forwardPE":13.832,"volume":6349,"regularMarketVolume":6349,"averageVolume":6467,"averageVolume10days":7155,"averageDailyVolume10Day":7155,"bid":135,"ask":136,"marketCap":2114270080,"nonDilutedMarketCap":2114270100,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":93.6,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":162,"allTimeHigh":162,"allTimeLow":2.7,"fulldayPrice":135,"fulldayChange":0,"fulldayChangePercent":0,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.124264,"fiftyDayAverage":150.632,"twoHundredDayAverage":136.762,"trailingAnnualDividendRate":6.45,"trailingAnnualDividendYield":0.0477778,"currency":"PLN","tradeable":false,"enterpriseValue":2643945984,"profitMargins":0.01351,"floatShares":10398450,"sharesOutstanding":15661260,"heldPercentInsiders":0.0529,"heldPercentInstitutions":0.56229,"impliedSharesOutstanding":15661260,"